<h1>Privacy</h1>
<h2>Optional analytics</h2>
<p>If you choose “Allow analytics,” Google Analytics receives page-view information, browser and device information, and network information such as your IP address. It uses first-party cookies to distinguish visits. Page addresses sent by this site exclude query strings and fragments. Google Analytics may also record standard session and engagement information. This site does not send contact-link clicks or other custom interaction events, and disables advertising personalization in its tag.</p>
<p>Until you opt in, this site does not load Google Analytics or send Google consent pings. Your choice is saved in this browser for 180 days. Use “Analytics choices” at the bottom of any page to change it. Turning analytics off stops future collection, clears this site’s accessible Analytics cookies, and reloads the page to unload Google’s code. It does not erase data already received by Google.</p>
<p>Google processes the information under its <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. Learn more about <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">Google’s use of information from partner sites</a>.</p>
<h2>Site preferences and weather</h2>
<p>Your theme preference and analytics choice are stored locally in this browser. Navigation may use temporary session storage. The background uses Denver daylight and National Weather Service observations from Denver International Airport, not your location. Your browser requests those observations directly from api.weather.gov, which receives the connection’s IP address. Observations are cached locally and refreshed every 15 minutes after a successful request. Failed requests retry at intervals of one to 15 minutes. A still-valid cached observation may be shown while refreshing; observations two hours old or older are not used.</p>
<h2>Hosting and links</h2>
<p>GitHub Pages hosts this site and receives normal request information when you visit. External links take you to sites with their own privacy practices. If you email me, I receive the information you send.</p>
<h2>Questions</h2>
<p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@chrismackintosh.work">hello@chrismackintosh.work</a>.</p>
</main><ProductFooter />
